cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use XIR, cite the associated paper using the preferred citation below.
  For data reuse, also cite the Kaggle dataset and the exact version used.
title: "XIR: Cross-Chain Protocol Interoperability"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "XIR Research Authors"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lysrain21/XIR"
url: "https://github.com/lysrain21/XIR"
abstract: >-
  Research implementation of a verifiable intermediate representation for
  composing cross-chain protocol connections. Solidity contracts and Python
  orchestration integrate Hyperlane and LayerZero V2 in controlled experiments.
keywords:
  - blockchain
  - cross-chain
  - interoperability
  - reachability
  - Hyperlane
  - LayerZero
